Note on game artwork and metadata

GameBox displays cover art, screenshots and descriptions for the games you
already own. That material is fetched at runtime, on your machine, from your
own launcher caches and from Steam's public endpoints, and it belongs to its
respective publishers. It is not part of this project and is not covered by
the licence above. No artwork is distributed with this source code.
